 <div class="gl">Weekly consistency</div><div class="grp gh"><div class="row"><div class="sp"><b style="font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.5px">${rate==null?'—':rate+'%'}</b><div class="mute">${cmp} of ${sch} routine sessions · goal ${goal}%</div></div><div class="chip">${rate!=null&&rate>=goal?'On track':'Keep going'}</div></div><div class="bar"><i style="width:${rate||0}%"></i></div></div>`;
